{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$-\\dfrac{1}{6}$", "explanation": "展开\n$$\n\\arctan x=x-\\frac{x^3}{3}+o(x^3),\\qquad \\ln(1+2x^3)=2x^3+o(x^3).\n$$\n故原式\n$$\n\\sim \\frac{-x^3/3}{2x^3}=-\\frac16.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$(\\ln2-1)\\,dx$", "explanation": "由 $x=0$ 时得 $y=1$。对方程两边微分：\n$$\n2^{xy}\\ln2\\,(x\\,dy+y\\,dx)=dx+dy.\n$$\n代入 $(x,y)=(0,1)$，得\n$$\n\\ln2\\,dx=dx+dy,\n$$\n故\n$$\ndy=(\\ln2-1)\\,dx.\n$$", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["广义积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}$", "explanation": "令\n$$\nx-2=t^2,\n$$\n则\n$$\ndx=2t\\,dt,\\qquad x+7=t^2+9.\n$$\n原式化为\n$$\n2\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{dt}{t^2+9}\n=\\frac{2}{3}\\left[\\arctan\\frac{t}{3}\\right]_0^{+\\infty}\n=\\frac{\\pi}{3}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["斜渐近线"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$y=2x+1$", "explanation": "当 $x\\to\\pm\\infty$ 时，\n$$\ne^{1/x}=1+\\frac1x+o\\left(\\frac1x\\right).\n$$\n故\n$$\ny=(2x-1)\\left(1+\\frac1x+o\\left(\\frac1x\\right)\\right)=2x+1+o(1),\n$$\n所以斜渐近线为\n$$\ny=2x+1.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵运算"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac12&0&0&0\\\\[2pt]0&\\frac14&0&0\\\\[2pt]0&\\frac{2}{5}&\\frac{3}{10}&0\\\\[2pt]0&0&\\frac{3}{7}&\\frac14\\end{pmatrix}$", "explanation": "由\n$$\nB=(E+A)^{-1}(E-A)\n$$\n得\n$$\nE+B=E+(E+A)^{-1}(E-A)=2(E+A)^{-1}.\n$$\n故\n$$\n(E+B)^{-1}=\\frac12(E+A).\n$$\n直接代入 $A$ 可得答案矩阵。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$D$", "explanation": "要在整个实轴连续，分母\n$$\na+e^{bx}\n$$\n不能为零。若 $b>0$，则 $x\\to-\\infty$ 时 $e^{bx}\\to0$，为使极限为 $0$ 需 $a\\ne0$，但还要兼顾连续性条件，排除其余选项。综合判断可得\n$$\na\\ge0,\\quad b<0,\n$$\n故选 $D$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极值", "拐点"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$C$", "explanation": "代入 $x=0$ 得\n$$\nf''(0)=0.\n$$\n再对题设求导，可得\n$$\nf'''(0)=1.\n$$\n因此 $x=0$ 附近二阶导数变号，故 $(0,f(0))$ 是拐点，选 $C$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["单调性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$A$", "explanation": "令\n$$\nF(x)=\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}.\n$$\n则\n$$\nF'(x)=\\frac{f'(x)g(x)-f(x)g'(x)}{g(x)^2}<0,\n$$\n故 $F(x)$ 单调递减。于是当 $a<x<b$ 时，\n$$\n\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}>\\frac{f(b)}{g(b)},\n$$\n即\n$$\nf(x)g(b)>f(b)g(x).\n$$\n选 $A$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$C$", "explanation": "由已知得\n$$\n\\sin6x+xf(x)=o(x^3).\n$$\n而\n$$\n\\sin6x=6x-36x^3+o(x^3),\n$$\n故\n$$\nx(6+f(x))=36x^3+o(x^3),\n$$\n从而\n$$\n\\frac{6+f(x)}{x^2}\\to36.\n$$\n选 $C$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$B$", "explanation": "由解的形式知特征根为\n$$\nr=-1\n$$\n（二重根）和\n$$\nr=1.\n$$\n故特征方程为\n$$\n(r+1)^2(r-1)=0=r^3+r^2-r-1.\n$$\n对应方程为\n$$\ny'''+y''-y'-y=0.\n$$\n选 $B$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac12[\\ln(1+e^x)]^2+C$", "explanation": "令\n$$\nt=e^x,\n$$\n则由题设\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{\\ln(1+e^x)}{e^x}.\n$$\n因此\n$$\n\\int f(x)\\,dx=\\int \\frac{\\ln(1+e^x)}{e^x}\\,dx\n=\\int \\frac{\\ln(1+t)}{t^2}\\,dt\n$$\n不便直接算。更简洁地令\n$$\nu=\\ln(1+e^x),\n$$\n则\n$$\ndu=\\frac{e^x}{1+e^x}\\,dx,\n$$\n整理可得原积分为\n$$\n\\frac12u^2+C=\\frac12[\\ln(1+e^x)]^2+C.\n$$", "methods": ["换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["平面几何", "分段积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "分段函数，见解析。", "explanation": "当 $0\\le t\\le1$ 时，左下部分是直角三角形，\n$$\nS(t)=\\frac{t^2}{2}.\n$$\n当 $1\\le t\\le2$ 时，右上角被截去一个直角三角形，\n$$\nS(t)=1-\\frac{(2-t)^2}{2}.\n$$\n当 $t\\ge2$ 时，\n$$\nS(t)=1.\n$$\n于是积分结果为\n$$\n\\int_0^xS(t)\\,dt=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\dfrac{x^3}{6},&0\\le x\\le1,\\\\[4pt]\n\\dfrac16+\\displaystyle\\int_1^x\\left(1-\\frac{(2-t)^2}{2}\\right)dt,&1\\le x\\le2,\\\\[8pt]\n\\dfrac{7}{6}+x-2,&x\\ge2.\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n化简中段可得对应三次多项式。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数", "Maclaurin"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$f^{(n)}(0)=(-1)^{n-3}\\dfrac{2n!}{(n-2)(n-1)n}$", "explanation": "由\n$$\n\\ln(1+x)=x-\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{x^3}{3}-\\cdots+(-1)^{k-1}\\frac{x^k}{k}+\\cdots\n$$\n得\n$$\nf(x)=x^3-\\frac{x^4}{2}+\\frac{x^5}{3}-\\cdots+(-1)^{n-3}\\frac{x^n}{n-2}+\\cdots\n$$\n故 $x^n$ 项系数为\n$$\n(-1)^{n-3}\\frac{1}{n-2}.\n$$\n于是\n$$\nf^{(n)}(0)=n!\\cdot(-1)^{n-3}\\frac{1}{n-2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$(1)$ 见解析；$(2)\\ \\dfrac{2}{\\pi}$。", "explanation": "函数 $|\\cos t|$ 以 $\\pi$ 为周期，且\n$$\n\\int_0^\\pi |\\cos t|\\,dt=2.\n$$\n因此当\n$$\nn\\pi\\le x<(n+1)\\pi\n$$\n时，\n$$\nS(x)=2n+\\int_{n\\pi}^{x}|\\cos t|\\,dt,\n$$\n故\n$$\n2n\\le S(x)<2(n+1).\n$$\n再由夹逼，\n$$\n\\frac{2n}{(n+1)\\pi}\\le \\frac{S(x)}{x}\\le \\frac{2(n+1)}{n\\pi},\n$$\n令 $x\\to+\\infty$ 即得\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{S(x)}{x}=\\frac{2}{\\pi}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 7, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["递推数列", "数列极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$8$ 年", "explanation": "设第 $n$ 年年底污染物含量为 $m_n$，则一年内流入污染物最多为\n$$\n\\frac{V}{6}\\cdot \\frac{m_0}{V}=\\frac{m_0}{6}.\n$$\n流出时带走当前总量的\n$$\n\\frac{V/3}{V}=\\frac13,\n$$\n故有递推关系\n$$\nm_{n+1}=\\frac23m_n+\\frac{m_0}{6}.\n$$\n由 $m_0^{(1999)}=5m_0$ 出发，解该递推式可得\n$$\nm_n-\\frac{m_0}{2}=\\left(\\frac23\\right)^n\\left(5m_0-\\frac{m_0}{2}\\right).\n$$\n求最小 $n$ 使 $m_n\\le m_0$，计算得需要 $8$ 年。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "proof", "score": 6, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["零点定理", "积分中值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "见解析。", "explanation": "若 $f$ 在 $(0,\\pi)$ 内没有零点或只有一个零点，则因连续性其符号变化至多一次。于是可取常数 $a,b$ 使\n$$\na+b\\cos x\n$$\n与 $f(x)$ 在 $(0,\\pi)$ 上同号。这样便有\n$$\n\\int_0^\\pi f(x)(a+b\\cos x)\\,dx\\ne0.\n$$\n但由题设\n$$\n\\int_0^\\pi f(x)\\,dx=0,\\qquad \\int_0^\\pi f(x)\\cos x\\,dx=0\n$$\n可得上式应为 $0$，矛盾。故至少有两个不同零点。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 7, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["周期函数", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=4x-23$", "explanation": "由周期为 $5$ 知\n$$\nf(6)=f(1).\n$$\n令 $x\\to0$，由 $\\sin x\\to0$ 得\n$$\nf(1)-3f(1)=0,\n$$\n故\n$$\nf(1)=0.\n$$\n再利用\n$$\n\\sin x=x+o(x)\n$$\n并在 $x=1$ 处作一阶展开：\n$$\nf(1+\\sin x)=f(1)+f'(1)\\sin x+o(x),\\quad\nf(1-\\sin x)=f(1)-f'(1)\\sin x+o(x).\n$$\n代入题设并比较 $x$ 的系数，得\n$$\n4f'(1)=8,\\qquad f'(1)=2.\n$$\n由于点 $(6,f(6))=(6,0)$，切线方程为\n$$\ny=2(x-6)=2x-12.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["最值", "旋转体体积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$a=\\dfrac12$，最大体积为 $\\dfrac{\\pi}{24}$", "explanation": "交点满足\n$$\nax^2=1-x^2,\n$$\n故\n$$\nx_A=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a+1}},\\qquad y_A=\\frac{a}{a+1}.\n$$\n直线 $OA$ 方程为\n$$\ny=\\frac{a}{\\sqrt{a+1}}x.\n$$\n于是所围图形绕 $x$ 轴旋转的体积为\n$$\nV(a)=\\pi\\int_0^{1/\\sqrt{a+1}}\\left[\\left(\\frac{a}{\\sqrt{a+1}}x\\right)^2-a^2x^4\\right]dx.\n$$\n化简得\n$$\nV(a)=\\frac{\\pi a^2}{15(a+1)^{5/2}}.\n$$\n求极值得\n$$\na=\\frac12,\n$$\n代回得最大体积\n$$\nV_{\\max}=\\frac{\\pi}{24}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "proof", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["积分方程", "不等式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "(1) $f'(x)=-\\dfrac{f(x)}{x+1}$；(2) 见解析。", "explanation": "对原式两边乘以 $x+1$ 并求导，可得\n$$\n(x+1)f''(x)+(x+2)f'(x)=0.\n$$\n积分并利用初值，可化为\n$$\nf'(x)=-\\frac{f(x)}{x+1}.\n$$\n于是\n$$\n\\frac{f'(x)}{f(x)}=-\\frac{1}{x+1},\n$$\n从而\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{C}{x+1}.\n$$\n结合 $f(0)=1$ 得 $C=1$，故\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac1{x+1}.\n$$\n显然对 $x\\ge0$，\n$$\ne^{-x}\\le \\frac1{x+1}\\le1.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$x=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\8\\end{pmatrix}$", "explanation": "先算\n$$\nB=\\beta^T\\alpha=1\\cdot1+\\frac12\\cdot2+0\\cdot1=2.\n$$\n又\n$$\nA=\\alpha\\beta^T\n$$\n是秩为 $1$ 的矩阵，并满足\n$$\nA^2=(\\beta^T\\alpha)A=2A.\n$$\n进而\n$$\nA^4=8A,\\qquad 2B^2A^2=16A,\\qquad B^4=16.\n$$\n原方程化为\n$$\n16Ax=8Ax+16x+\\gamma,\n$$\n即\n$$\n8Ax-16x=\\gamma.\n$$\n解得\n$$\nx=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\8\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2000", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2000, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "solution", "score": 7, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["向量组秩", "线性表示"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2000_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2000_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$a=1,\\ b=2$", "explanation": "先求向量组 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3$ 的秩。由\n$$\n\\alpha_3=3\\alpha_1+2\\alpha_2\n$$\n可知其秩为 $2$。\n\n又 $\\beta_3$ 可由 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3$ 线性表示，而这些向量都在由 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2$ 张成的平面内，故\n$$\n\\beta_3=s\\alpha_1+t\\alpha_2.\n$$\n解该方程组得\n$$\nb=2.\n$$\n再由 $\\beta$ 组与 $\\alpha$ 组同秩，要求 $\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\beta_3$ 的秩也为 $2$，据此可得\n$$\na=1.\n$$", "methods": []}
